This is Smatiny, an implementation of the Smatiny language defined by ihope.

    <http://esoteric.voxelperfect.net/wiki/SMATINY>

See the included files smatiny-test and smatiny-test2 for examples. In fact, 
as their paths imply, these make great tests:

./smatiny smatiny-test # should print "Hi!"
./smatiny smatiny-test2 # should print "Hello, World!"

COMPILATION

You'll need GHC <http://haskell.org/ghc> (or, in fact, any other Haskell compiler).

ghc -o smatiny --make Main.hs